<h2 id="data-flow-diagram">Data Flow — A Complete Backtest Day</h2>

<div class="diagram-container">
<pre class="mermaid">
sequenceDiagram
    participant E as BacktestEngine
    participant S as _slice_data
    participant C as AgentController
    participant H as run_hedge_fund()
    participant T as TradeExecutor
    participant V as _validate_trade
    participant P as Portfolio
    participant MK as mark_to_market
    participant M as MetricsCalc
    participant O as OutputFormatter

    E->>S: slice(current_date)
    S-->>E: data_window (prices, news, metrics up to date)
    E->>C: run_day(date, data_window, portfolio_snapshot)
    C->>H: run_hedge_fund(tickers, date, portfolio)
    Note over H: Analyst agents evaluate tickers<br/>PM synthesizes signals<br/>Risk manager applies constraints
    H-->>C: [BUY AAPL 50, SHORT MSFT 30]
    C-->>E: trade_decisions
    E->>T: execute_all(decisions, portfolio, prices)
    loop Each decision
        T->>V: validate(decision, portfolio, price)
        V-->>T: valid=true
        T->>P: update_position(AAPL, +50, long, 185.20)
        P-->>T: position_updated
    end
    T-->>E: execution_report (2 executed, 0 rejected)
    E->>MK: mark_to_market(portfolio, closing_prices)
    MK-->>E: portfolio_value=102,340
    E->>M: update(date, 102340, spy_value)
    M-->>E: sharpe=1.23, sortino=1.87, mdd=0.031
    E->>O: render_day(date, report, metrics)
    O-->>E: (printed to terminal)
</pre>
</div>

